fun g<U where U is P, U.X is P, U.X.X is P, U.X.X.X is P, U.X.X.X.X is P, U.X.X.X.X.X is P, U.X.X.X.X.X.X is P, U.X.X.X.X.X.X.X is P, U.X.X.X.X.X.X.X.X is P, U.X.X.X.X.X.X.X.X.X is Q>() { f<U>() }
